{"id":"7593f0ca3b4f470d","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-double-recursion.md","title":"带参数双递归定理","display":"thm-double-recursion — 带参数双递归定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-double-recursion","aliases":["20-thm-double-recursion"],"display":"thm-double-recursion — 带参数双递归定理","chapter":"2","section":"2.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 2.3.14(i),(ii)","source_printed_pages":[37],"source_pdf_pages":[73],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-double-recursion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-double-recursion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-double-recursion — 带参数双递归定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.3.14(i),(ii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>37</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f81acfa76416d15\" href=\"?note=4f81acfa76416d15\" title=\"20-thm-recursion-parameters\">20-thm-recursion-parameters</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\in\\mathcal C_3^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(f,g\\in\\mathcal C_3^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\omega\">\\(z\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4f81acfa76416d15\" href=\"?note=4f81acfa76416d15\" title=\"20-thm-recursion-parameters\">20-thm-recursion-parameters</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}double\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\exists a,b\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall z\\ [\\varphi_{a(z)}=\\varphi_{f(a(z),b(z),z)}\\land\\varphi_{b(z)}=\\varphi_{g(a(z),b(z),z)}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}double\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\exists a,b\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall z\\ [\\varphi_{a(z)}=\\varphi_{f(a(z),b(z),z)}\\land\\varphi_{b(z)}=\\varphi_{g(a(z),b(z),z)}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先以 y,z 为参数得到全可计算 α(y,z)，满足 φ_α(y,z)=φ_f(α(y,z),y,z)。对全变换 y↦g(α(y,z),y,z) 再应用参数递归定理，得 b(z)。令 a(z)=α(b(z),z)，代入两式即可。固定 z 给无参数双固定点。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.3.14(i),(ii)；印刷页 37；PDF 第 73 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-recursion-parameters","status":"resolved","id":"4f81acfa76416d15","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-recursion-parameters","status":"resolved","id":"4f81acfa76416d15","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,g\\in\\mathcal C_3^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}double\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\exists a,b\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall z\\ [\\varphi_{a(z)}=\\varphi_{f(a(z),b(z),z)}\\land\\varphi_{b(z)}=\\varphi_{g(a(z),b(z),z)}].","display":true}],"bytes":1332,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-double-recursion]] — 章 2；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-double-recursion]]"}],"outgoing":["4f81acfa76416d15","8ba6597a854c206f","e343870c773cb68e"]}